"""
Figure 5: Phase 3 single-tip comparison (C8 vs GF-C borosilicate vs TIMAHAC tandem).
TRANSPARENT background version. Self-contained. 8 panels in 2x4 layout.

Detection columns are clean: startswith() avoids the GFC2mg_GP collision,
the dataset carries no exposed REV decoy intensity columns, and MaxLFQ
columns are excluded. Numbers are identical to the original Figure 5; only
the background is made transparent and the assembled DPI raised to 600.

Data:
    Exp3-PP_C8-GFC-TIM_Peptide_Precursor_Report.csv  (PP fraction, Spectronaut)
    Exp3-GP_combined_modified_peptide.tsv             (GP fraction, FragPipe)
    1150482-1150497_Exp3-GP_Summary.xlsx              (GP summary for counts)
Panels:
    A: N-glycopeptide count by workflow (C8/GFC/TIM, n=4 each)
    B: GP fraction composition (N-glyco / Phos / Unmod) %
    C: N-glyco CV violin
    D: Glycan classification stacked %  (4-class, Hybrid folded into Complex)
    E: Phospho count by workflow x fraction (C8 AP/ACN, GFC AP/ACN)
    F: Phospho selectivity dot plot (red mean line)
    G: Phospho workflow comparison: C8 (AP+ACN) vs GFC (AP) vs TIMAHAC
    H: Phospho CV violin (C8 ACN, GFC AP, TIMAHAC)
Notes:
    - GFC AP rep R1 excluded as outlier (drop_r1=True)
    - All PP panels recomputed from raw prec.csv for internal consistency
"""
